{'symbol': 'NRG', 'date': '2023-03-02 17:12:00', 'title': 'NRG ENERGY, INC. ANNOUNCES PRICING OF SENIOR SECURED FIRST LIEN NOTES DUE 2033 AND SERIES A FIXED-RATE RESET CUMULATIVE REDEEMABLE PERPETUAL PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': 'HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NRG ENERGY, INC. (NYSE:NRG) HAS PRICED ITS OFFERINGS OF (I) $740.0 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 7.000% SENIOR SECURED FIRST LIEN NOTES DUE 2033 AT A PRICE TO THE PUBLIC OF 98.749% OF THEIR FACE VALUE (THE “NOTES”) AND (II) 650,000 SHARES OF 10.25% SERIES A FIXED-RATE RESET CUMULATIVE REDEEMABLE PERPETUAL PREFERRED STOCK, WITH A $1,000 LIQUIDATION PREFERENCE PER SHARE (THE “PREFERRED SHARES”). THE NOTES MATURE ON MARCH 15, 2033.'}